{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"e3d467cdced1a9e46afacb9ac55d87dbfd626929825ee77a9233b03144b82613","ja":"着ぐるみが人だかりで動けなくなってたの、\nよく気づいたわね、育。","zh":"人偶装因为人群围着动弹不得这件事，\n你注意得真仔细呢，育。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"0730c14e9869609f14f9a89ffdf4785f6f42b58a20f9101187e46ff9bd6fab88","ja":"えへへっ♪　伊織さんのおかげだよ。みんなのこと、\nよく見ようって、思ってたから気づけたの。","zh":"嘿嘿♪　多亏了伊织。因为想着要\n好好关注大家，才注意到的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"7bf274dad5b4ee8087c328c850957395263ea4f3910f12aeceb42e3fe2d5c72a","ja":"はい、チラシどうぞ。\nよかったら、イベントも見てね。……んんっ。","zh":"给，这是传单。\n可以的话，活动也来看一看吧。……嗯哼。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"ba8b718a1d3b6bea3487b1517a7c8f07042008be8e34bf5d7c5d27723d3d6206","ja":"「おかあさん、おねえちゃんすっごくかわいいね」\n「そうね、笑顔が素敵。ちょっと見ていこうか？」","zh":"「妈妈，大姐姐好可爱呀」\n「是呢，笑容真迷人。要稍微停下来看一会儿吗？」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"96cc2bdffe492c20d608f96dd4d6fefabbc39000bbd908efa3e390e3015002f6","ja":"（くふふっ。ちょっとてれちゃうけど、うれしいぞ）","zh":"（嘻嘻。虽然有点不好意思，但好开心啊）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"fc74c7fae4d740b3d5b103c9d90de44869700530111af5f17665da8e6e36edb7","ja":"ご来場、ありがとうございます！\nわからないことは、なんでも聞いてくださいね。","zh":"感谢您的莅临！\n有什么不懂的，请随时询问哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"518a8b0a16e6129fb5bb20c4d31fa244c811a107008b7a77afc25a8f4a0276a4","ja":"あ、こんにちはーっ！\n遊びにきてくださーいっ！","zh":"啊，你好——！\n来找我玩嘛——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"64b8629c6c332042b5f71d38191d753bdef05aef0ddae7590c06a313148d20af","ja":"そして6人のPR活動は終わり……","zh":"然后，6人的宣传活动结束了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"254dabd7f961e66bd43591a16edf318993800e2bc621c2078033c57a43e2c2b6","ja":"「イベント大成功でした！　さすがいい子のみなさん。\nすばらしいチームワークですね！」","zh":"“活动大获成功！真不愧是乖孩子们。\n配合真是太默契了呢！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"0b9c56b600e201532bbb6cf7903978dbfe54acd1a41435c163442dbb4b7e8190","ja":"えへへ……♪　わたしたちも、勉強できちゃいました。\n大きな声が出せなくても、できることがあるって。","zh":"嘿嘿……♪　我们也学到了呢。\n就算发不出很大的声音，也有能够做到的事情。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"059590dd46522265902b0d5929ab55bbfa1d0fe279e53dab8ba3d669b322b491","ja":"うん。みんなが助けてくれたから、\nたまきも最後までいっぱい、せんでんできたんだ。","zh":"嗯。因为大家帮了我，\n环才能在最后大力宣传了个够。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1758.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"676d26fe245c581d80e09ca856ee71a8720f187ad7ca24014834db37f3cf614a","ja":"またお手伝いさせてくださいっ！\nいつでも、6人みんなで力を合わせて頑張りま～すっ！","zh":"请务必让我再来帮忙！\n无论何时，我们6人都会齐心协力一起加油的～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:50:40+00:00"}
